# CommitGuard does not read any environment variables yet.
#
# The first local version needs no credentials, network access, or database.
# The names below are RESERVED for planned features and are listed only so the
# intended shape is documented. Never commit a real .env file.

# Phase 4 (GitHub enforcement) - opt-in, only used by GitHub integration code.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Future (audit storage) - opt-in, local SQLite first.
# COMMITGUARD_AUDIT_DB=.commitguard/audit.sqlite3
